{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"Let me reconsider the puzzle. The key constraint is \"the award itself was originally created in the 2000s.\" The Booker Prize was created in 1969, so that doesn't fit. But the Man Booker International Prize was created in 2005 (2000s). However, Obioma's novels were shortlisted for the regular Booker Prize, not the International one.\n\nLet me reconsider. Maybe the award is the Man Asian Literary Prize (created 2007). Let me check the Man Asian Literary Prize winners and shortlist in the 2010s, and whether any shortlisted book was translated into 25+ languages.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Man Asian Literary Prize winners list 2010 2011 2012 2013\", \"Man Asian Literary Prize shortlist translated 25 languages\", \"Man Asian Literary Prize Wikipedia history\"]}","name":"search"},"id":"call_8f67cc30c96045bbae1203db","index":0,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789478240,"id":"chatcmpl-94d48c7e-220c-97d5-b83a-a4ec3f798d34","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":18661,"completion_tokens":178,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":18839,"cached_tokens":12672,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":12672},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}